<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">Philemon</book>
  <para style="h">Philemon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Philemon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philemon</para>
  <para style="mt">Philemon</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Jesu Khrist suongkul taangpa leh i unaupa uh Timothi in ka lawm ittah u’leh ka seppipa uh Philemon kung leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ittah uh Apphia leh ka galkappi uh Arkippa leh na inn a kikhawm hattuomte kungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I Pa Pasian leh Mangpa Jesu Khrist akipat hepina leh lungmuonna na kungah um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thungetnate ah na min louin ka Pasian kungah kipahthu ka gen ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa Jesu lama na ginna leh misiengthou zousie lam a itna na neidan ka zah in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na ginna midangte na kikoppina in, Khrist Jesu a nangma a um silhoi chinteng theikimna lam a ahing phattuom theina ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na itna ah kouten lungnopna leh kinepna thupitah ka nei uhi, aziehpen unaupa, nangma ziehin misiengthoute lungtangte ahalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin akilawm hun banga bawl dingin Khrist ah thupieh hangsantah ahing pethei hinan leng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Itna ziehin Keima Paul, tehsepu leh tu mama a zong Jesu Khrist hentapa’n ka hing ngen zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka koltanna a ka hinkhiet ka tapa Onesimus a dingin na kungah ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khatvei lai in ama nanga dingin aphatuom sih a, hinanleh tuin vang nang leh kei a dingin aphatuomta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama pen ka hing nua sawl kia hi, Tuaziehin ama na pom in, ama ka lungtang ah atengden vawt hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khantanhoi zieha kolbun a ka um sungin nang taanga ka nna hing seppieh dingin ama ka umdensah ut mama a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh nang phatsahna umlou in bangma ka bawl ut sih hi, na nasep hoi pen, sep sah teitei hilou a, nangma utna a bawl ahi theizoh na ding ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama toh hun tomkhat na kikhen pen uh, ama na neiden theina ding ahizaw mai thei hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuin pen suoh banga nei hi nawnlouin, suoh sanga hoizaw, sanggam ittah bangin ahi zaw ding hi, adiehin ama kei a dingin it huoitah ahita a, nanga dingin tahsa leh Mangpa lam ah it huoitah ahi zaw sem nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin Kei na lawmhoi khat a na hing sim leh, keima bangin na pom in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na tunga bawlkhiel anei a, bat bangma anei lezong keima batin na sim in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima Paul in tami ka khut ngel a ka gel ahi, Keima’n ka sanpieh ding hi. Nangma ngelin zong kei kungah bat na nei ka china ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi, unaupa aw, nangma akipat kipahna Mangpa ah hing nei sah in, Khrist ah ka lungtang hing suthathou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na thumanna a kimuongin leh ka gen sanga thupizaw tham in na bawl ding chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuabang kaal ah kei dingin zong tunna ding inn khat zong hing na ngaituo piehin, aziehpen na thungetnate uh zieh a, na kung ua pieh a ka um ding, ka kigingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khrist Jesu zieha, ka hentatpipa Epaphras in mangpha ahing hah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka naseppi Mak, Aristarkus, Dema leh Luke, in zong noute mangpha ang hah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I Mangpa Jesu Khrist hepina hagau na kung uah um hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
